  "title": {
   "en": "Tsuihou Ouji wa Dorei kara Yarinaosu"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "追放皇子の帝位奪還"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Tsuihou Ouji ha Dorei kara Yarinaosu"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Exiled Prince Starts over as a Slave"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "The Marb Empire is ruled by two pillars of power—the Emperor and the Pope. Ilha, born with the blood of both, was destined for greatness. But treachery struck. His mother was slain, and Ilha was falsely accused, exiled, and enslaved.\n\nTen years of suffering pass, until he crosses paths with Sio, a persecuted girl of the demon tribe. Sio's people were massacred by the empire, and her heart burns for revenge.\n\nMoved by Sio’s unyielding fury, Ilha makes a choice—he will reclaim everything that was stolen from him. The time has come to rise, to fight, and to destroy the empire that cast him aside.",
   "ja": "皇帝と法王が並び立ち、治める国マーブ帝国。\nこの国で皇帝と法王、双方の血を継ぎ、将来を熱望され生まれたイルハだったが、\n策略により母を殺され、罪を被せられ追放、奴隷にされてしまう。\nそれから十年。\n辛く苦しい日々を耐えてきたイルハの前に現れたのは、魔族と呼ばれ迫害される少女・シオ。\n一族を虐殺され、帝国への復讐に燃えるシオの激情に感化され、イルハは全てを取り戻す戦いへ身を投じることを決意する──。"
  },
